- Call scanner.reconcile() which resolves keyimages to outputs to mark as spent\
\
Scanner Inventory\
- Pubkey + Birthday\
- Outputs are unspent or spent (spent key image found on-chain)\
- Scanner balance is total unspent Outputs, used for solvency \
- TxKeys are only used to audit outgoing is as per THOR schedule (slash if not)\
\
Solvency Checker\
- When Scanner at tip, and total Unspent is less than THOR minus margin == slash\
\
Txkey Validation\
- if Non-signing Nodes validate txkey and find incorrect amount or destination address or excessive gas == slash \
